@startuml FastBite_State_Outbox
title FastBite - Estados da Outbox (OutboxStatus)

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> PENDING : OutboxService.enqueue(...)

PENDING --> PROCESSING : PublishOutboxEventJob\nmarkProcessing
FAILED --> PROCESSING : retry quando next_attempt_at permite

PROCESSING --> PUBLISHED : evento publicado com sucesso
PROCESSING --> FAILED : exception ao publicar\nmarkRetryAfterFailure

PUBLISHED --> [*]

note right of FAILED
  Guarda retry_count, next_attempt_at e last_error.
  O job pode relancar a excecao para a queue voltar a tentar.
end note

@enduml
